 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, I'm Ellen, I look after Mr Doyle in the evenings. He's up passing water five or six times every night, and neither of us is sleeping."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's not that many. Three, maybe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "It's five, Walter. I count them, I hear you every time."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "So three, says Mr Doyle, and Ellen counts five or six. I'll note it as three to six. How long has it been going on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A few months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Are you drinking a lot in the evening? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A pot of tea, and a glass of water with my pills. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any burning, or blood in the urine?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you find it hard to start, or a weak stream?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, a weak stream. And I dribble afterwards."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What tablets are you on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Tamsulosin, 400 micrograms, once a day, in the morning."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is that helping? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any other conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "An enlarged prostate. That's what the tamsulosin is for."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness, or swelling of the legs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. Nothing like that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse and pressure, please. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 70, blood pressure 138 over 82.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is that all right? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Mr Doyle, I'd like to examine your tummy and then do a prostate check, if you agree. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "If you must.",
   "pause": 25.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your bladder isn't enlarged, and the prostate is smooth and enlarged, but not hard."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is it the prostate, then? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Most likely, together with the weak stream and the dribbling. I'd like to confirm that with a urine test and blood tests, including a kidney test and a PSA."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "The PSA, is that the cancer test? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's one marker, and it can be raised by an enlarged prostate too. I'll explain the result with you, whatever it is. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Cut down on tea and fluids after six, and avoid caffeine in the evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I'll make his supper earlier. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two weeks, when the results are back."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Two weeks. We'll come. ~"
  }
 ],
